      "id": "sandbox-chapter-1",
      "chapterNumber": 1,
      "title": "InDesign Export Sandbox",
      "audioFileName": "sandbox-audio.mp3",
      "plainText": "StJohn export sandbox: The pink lantern waited under the arch. The inline moth fluttered beside the glass key. The full spread city opened under the moon. Mara counted three quiet breaths. Cassian held the map steady. The dramatic vow snapped in the dark. The romantic glance softened the room. The funny mistake made everyone laugh. The custom ache moved through the bond. The custom dread made the window tremble. The shared vow carried Mara and Cassian together. The repeated phrase appears here. Later, the repeated phrase appears again.",
      "textHtml": "<p>StJohn export sandbox: The pink lantern waited under the arch. The inline moth fluttered beside the glass key. The full spread city opened under the moon. Mara counted three quiet breaths. Cassian held the map steady. The dramatic vow snapped in the dark. The romantic glance softened the room. The funny mistake made everyone laugh. The custom ache moved through the bond. The custom dread made the window tremble. The shared vow carried Mara and Cassian together. The repeated phrase appears here. Later, the repeated phrase appears again.</p>"
    }
